# Onboarding Components

## Component Overview

The onboarding system consists of two main overlay components that share styling and behavior patterns:

### Components
- **[lib/shared/onboarding_overlay.dart](mdc:lib/shared/onboarding_overlay.dart)** - Welcome/introduction overlay
- **[lib/shared/onboarding_subscription_overlay.dart](mdc:lib/shared/onboarding_subscription_overlay.dart)** - Subscription selection overlay
- **[lib/onboarding_screen.dart](mdc:lib/onboarding_screen.dart)** - Main onboarding screen with background
- **[lib/splash_screen.dart](mdc:lib/splash_screen.dart)** - App entry splash screen

## Shared Styling

All onboarding components use styles from **[lib/styles/onboarding_styles.dart](mdc:lib/styles/onboarding_styles.dart)**:

### SplashScreenStyles
- `backgroundColor` - Consistent splash background color
- `splashDuration` - Standard 2-second delay
- `logoSizeRatio` - Responsive logo sizing (0.8)

### OnboardingOverlayStyles
- `overlayDecoration` - Standard gradient decoration with border radius and shadows
- `overlayPadding` - Consistent padding for overlay content
- `contentSpacing` - Standard spacing between sections (18.0)
- `subscribeButtonStyle` / `startButtonStyle` - Reusable button styling

## Animation Patterns

### Overlay Entry Animation
```dart
